{"unit_id":"Alan2Z__dsh-speak#card-zh","repo":"Alan2Z/dsh-speak","commit":"a29bf66a88a9f775769da3f0d380112751efd76f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-speak 是一款面向 DSH Web 的语音播报插件：它监听会话事件，并在 Windows 使用系统 SAPI 语音、在 macOS 调用 say 朗读最终回复。插件可播报审批请求和用户提问，提供 FIFO 播报队列、回复重播按钮及可选事件提醒；设置页支持切换自动朗读、文本清理、代码块和长文本策略。适合希望离开屏幕时仍能听到任务结果或审批提示的 DSH 用户，也附有 Claude Code Stop hook 适配。需要本机可用的系统语音，不需配置云端 API。","source":"generated","evidence":["adapters/dsh/speech-hook.js:327-332","client/client.js:290-420","engine/speak.ps1:175","engine/speak.sh:132"]}
{"unit_id":"Alan2Z__dsh-speak#card-en","repo":"Alan2Z/dsh-speak","commit":"a29bf66a88a9f775769da3f0d380112751efd76f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-speak reads DSH replies aloud through Windows SAPI or macOS say. It announces approvals and questions, queues speech, and lets users replay replies. A settings page controls speech and text handling; a Claude Code Stop hook is included. It uses local system speech.","source":"generated","evidence":["adapters/dsh/speech-hook.js:327-332","client/client.js:290-420","engine/speak.ps1:175","engine/speak.sh:132"]}
